<p style="font-size:14px;">
  A few days ago you scored <strong><%= @assessment.score %>/100</strong> on the DSCSA readiness
  check. One gap worth looking at first:
</p>

<p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; margin: 16px 0 4px;"><%= @gap[:category] %></p>
<p style="font-size:14px; color:#444;"><%= @gap[:gap] %></p>
<p style="font-size:14px;"><strong>A first step you can take this week:</strong> <%= DscsaAssessment.next_step_for(@gap) %></p>

<% if @platform_solved %>
  <p style="font-size:14px;">
    <%= link_to "See how Pharma Transport closes it", pricing_url %> &mdash; live GPS tracking,
    an immutable chain-of-custody log, and continuous cold-chain monitoring are the whole
    product, not an add-on tier.
  </p>
<% else %>
  <p style="font-size:14px;">
    This one's a process gap, not something software alone fixes &mdash; it's exactly what the
    <%= link_to "fractional compliance officer", compliance_officer_url %> retainer is for: a named
    professional who writes the SOPs and owns the answer, instead of it landing on you.
  </p>
<% end %>

<p style="font-size:14px;">
  <% if DscsaDeadline.passed? %>
    The small-dispenser exemption ended <strong><%= DscsaDeadline.label %></strong>, so this applies now. A 14-day free trial
  <% else %>
    The FDA extended the small-dispenser exemption to <strong><%= DscsaDeadline.label %></strong> &mdash; a year to get this right rather than rushed. A 14-day free trial
  <% end %>
  is enough to see whether this closes the gap for your pharmacy &mdash;
  <%= link_to "start one", new_user_registration_url %>.
</p>

<p style="font-size:14px;">
  Your full action plan &mdash; every gap, with a first step and a place to assign an owner &mdash; is one click away:
  <%= link_to "download it as a PDF", dscsa_assessment_report_url(@assessment.token) %>.
</p>

<p style="font-size:12px; color:#666; margin-top:28px;">
  You're getting this because you requested a DSCSA readiness score.
  <%= link_to "Unsubscribe", @unsubscribe_url %> from this follow-up.
</p>
